# Committed template for edge-function secrets. Copy to supabase/functions/.env for local dev
# (that file is gitignored — never commit it).
#
# ANTHROPIC_API_KEY is a server-only secret: it is read by the analyze-form edge function and
# must NEVER get an EXPO_PUBLIC_ prefix and must NEVER be placed in the app's .env — those are
# inlined in plain text into the compiled app bundle.
#
# Local dev: copy this file to supabase/functions/.env and fill in the real key.
# Production:  supabase secrets set ANTHROPIC_API_KEY=<the real key>
ANTHROPIC_API_KEY=
